   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Gel colour: median ~46 with lifted blacks (p1 ~23), blue-violet shadows (42,34,56 / hue 262), cyan-tinted highlights (196,217,219 / hue 185), aqua 30% + blue 24% of colour mass, saturation 0.52, warm skin (hue 19 / sat 0.46) held against the gels. Best for: Coloured-light and neon portraits, LED-lit receptions and sangeet stages, creative studio frames with gels, night-club style couple shots. Stylised.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
